sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express

  U->>FE: buka halaman privat
  FE->>API: GET /api/mp/me cookie
  alt JWT valid
    API-->>FE: session user
    FE-->>U: render halaman
  else token hilang / rusak
    API-->>FE: 401
    FE-->>U: redirect /login
  end

  U->>FE: Logout
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/logout
  API-->>FE: hapus cookie
  FE-->>U: kembali ke beranda
